	{
		{"text"},
		line=680,
	},
	{
		{"mwf"},
		{"msgoff"},
		{"bg", del=2, lv=0, id=31, path=":bg/", file="black", time=1000, wait=500, sync=1},
		{"bgm", stop=1, [1]="", time=1500},
		{"excall", call=0, file="hat020210"},
		line=680,
	},
	text={
		[1]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I will accompany Akari.”",
			},
		},
		[2]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What are you saying? Your original goal was to rescue Kokuan, wasn't it?”",
			},
		},
		[3]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“A warrior is his lord's blade. My only purpose is ensuring your protection.”",
			},
		},
		[4]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Umm, who exactly might Miyaguni-sama...”",
			},
		},
		[5]={
			{
"Koyuzu tries to interject, but Hotori interrupts her.",
			},
		},
		[6]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“I wouldn't expect anything less from you, Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[7]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Hold it, Inou!”",
			},
		},
		[8]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“We can't afford to waste more time here.”",
			},
		},
		[9]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“If we want to rescue my father and search for the Treasures, it's only reasonable to split up.”",
			},
		},
		[10]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“You don't have to tell me that.”",
			},
		},
		[11]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“And nobody can separate you and Soujin, so there we have it.”",
			},
		},
		[12]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“And I'm telling you, that premise of yours is way off.”",
			},
		},
		[13]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“In the first place, weren't you the one who ordered me to protect you as a condition for bringing you along?”",
			},
		},
		[14]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ooh...”",
			},
		},
		[15]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Who's the only one here that knows all about the palace's layout?”",
			},
		},
		[16]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“If it's that dangerous, you'll just have to try twice as hard as usual to protect me.”",
			},
		},
		[17]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“...”",
			},
		},
		[18]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Very well.”",
			},
		},
		[19]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Th-That's playing dirty!”",
			},
		},
		[20]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“How so?”",
			},
		},
		[21]={
			{
"Akari and I glare at each other for a solid ten seconds.",
			},
		},
		[22]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Fine, fine.”",
			},
		},
		[23]={
			{
"Akari finally gives in, though not without making her displeasure evident.",
			},
		},
		[24]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin, you come with me.”",
			},
		},
		[25]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“See to my protection.”",
			},
		},
		[26]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Understood.”",
			},
		},
		[27]={
			{
"I step away from Hotori's side and move beside Akari.",
			},
		},
		[28]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm gonna borrow Soujin for a bit.”",
			},
		},
		[29]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Go right ahead.”",
			},
		},
		[30]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[31]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I'm sorry I can't be there for you.”",
			},
		},
		[32]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Ours is but to do and die for our lords. You have nothing to apologize for.”",
			},
		},
		[33]={
			{
"Hotori shows me an understanding smile.",
			},
		},
		[34]={
			{
"Yet beneath that benevolent expression, there lies an unmistakable tinge of loneliness.",
			},
		},
		[35]={
			{
"It's not that I'm unaware of Hotori's feelings.",
			},
		},
		[36]={
			{
"But there are things that I simply must protect, even at the cost of all else that is dear to me.",
			},
		},
		[37]={
			{
"That I might never give them voice, I forcefully swallow down these bitter regrets of mine.",
			},
		},
		[38]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“We'll be back.”",
			},
		},
		[39]={
			name={"name", name="Hotori"},
			{
"“Good hunting.”",
			},
		},
		[40]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Good hunting.”",
			},
		},
		[41]={
			{
"I turn and face Koyuzu, standing at attention by Hotori's side.",
			},
		},
		[42]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Koyuzu, take care of Hotori.”",
			},
		},
		[43]={
			name={"name", name="Koyuzu"},
			{
"“Yes, sir! Even at the cost of my life!”",
			},
		},
		[44]={
			{
"We proceed through the mazelike underground corridors for a long while before finally emerging aboveground.",
			},
		},
		[45]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(That passage leads us straight here to the inner courtyard.)”",
			},
		},
		[46]={
			{
"Akari whispers quietly into my ear.",
			},
		},
		[47]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(That's some ingenious construction.)”",
			},
		},
		[48]={
			{
"As I turn towards her, I suddenly find Akari's well-featured face right before my own.",
			},
		},
		[49]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Ah?!”",
			},
		},
		[50]={
			{
"I frantically cover her mouth.",
			},
		},
		[51]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(Keep your voice down!)”",
			},
		},
		[52]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Mmhmm mmh mhm hmm?)”",
			},
		},
		[53]={
			{
"She seems to be saying, “Wasn't that your fault?”",
			},
		},
		[54]={
			{
"Whatever she says...",
			},
		},
		[55]={
			{
"I let go of her once she finally settles down.",
			},
		},
		[56]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(So, where is our objective?)”",
			},
		},
		[57]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(Follow me.)”",
			},
		},
		[58]={
			{
"With no hesitation at soiling her clothes, Akari ducks beneath the veranda of a nearby building.",
			},
		},
		[59]={
			{
"I see. They'll have a harder time spotting us this way.",
			},
		},
		[60]={
			{
"We slowly crawl our way forward for some time before emerging in a wide-open space.",
			},
		},
		[61]={
			{
"What lies right before us is a solemn quadrangle measuring roughly fifty meters across, enclosed on all sides by a stately colonnade.",
			},
		},
		[62]={
			{
"The entire courtyard is meticulously paved with a luminous white gravel that seems to glow with the light of the moon itself.",
			},
		},
		[63]={
			{
"At the precise center of this cloister, almost as though placed there by Oomikami Himself, sits a small reliquary.",
			},
		},
		[64]={
			{
"The terrifyingly tranquil aura of this place tells me that we have indeed found the Shireiden.",
			},
		},
		[65]={
			{
"With only a small nod to each other, Akari and I step upon the pristine white gravel.",
			},
		},
		[66]={
			{
"There is no cover whatsoever between us and the shrine itself.",
			},
		},
		[67]={
			{
"We'd be spotted the instant a guard wanders by on patrol.",
			},
		},
		[68]={
			{
"With great trepidation, we approach the Shireiden's entrance.",
			},
		},
		[69]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“(It's not even locked.)”",
			},
		},
		[70]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(What?)”",
			},
		},
		[71]={
			{
"She seems to be right, as I can see neither lock nor keyhole on the entrance.",
			},
		},
		[72]={
			{
"If there are indeed priceless treasures within, surely it ought to be under tight lock and key.",
			},
		},
		[73]={
			{
"At any rate, I reach for the door to try and open it.",
			},
		},
		[74]={
			{
"Yet in that moment─",
			},
		},
		[75]={
			{
"My entire body breaks out with gooseflesh.",
			},
		},
		[76]={
			{
"Someone is watching us.",
			},
		},
		[77]={
			{
"I crane my head up to spot the sharp silhouette of a figure with the moon at their back.",
			},
		},
		[78]={
			{
"Clutched in their hand, a spellblade radiates with rancor as black as a moonless night.",
			},
		},
		[79]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“(A warrior?!)”",
			},
		},
		[80]={
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Haah!”",
			},
		},
		[81]={
			{
"A blinding flash of steel that drowns out the light of the moon itself.",
			},
		},
		[82]={
			{
"Faster than the speed of sound, the Sickle Leaf races through the air towards Akari.",
			},
		},
		[83]={
			{
"If I do nothing, it will tear her apart like a flower petal within a tempest.",
			},
		},
		[84]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Akari!”",
			},
		},
		[85]={
			{
"I pour all my strength into my blade.",
			},
		},
		[86]={
			{
"Every muscle in my body screams with protest at the command to surpass their physical limits.",
			},
		},
		[87]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Whoooooaaaaaaagh!”",
			},
		},
		[88]={
			{
"My bones creak and groan.",
			},
		},
		[89]={
			{
"─Faster!",
			},
		},
		[90]={
			{
"Blood vessels split and muscle fibers rupture.",
			},
		},
		[91]={
			{
"─Even faster!",
			},
		},
		[92]={
			{
"─Before Akari's life becomes as water droplets on the wind!",
			},
		},
		[93]={
			{
"The furious exertion overwhelms all my faculties, and all my senses are painted over with a black numbness.",
			},
		},
		[94]={
			{
"All that remains to remind me I'm alive is the warmth still clutched in my right hand.",
			},
		},
		[95]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Sou... jin?”",
			},
		},
		[96]={
			{
"An august voice, like the sound of many waters.",
			},
		},
		[97]={
			{
"The voice I would give everything to protect.",
			},
		},
		[98]={
			{
"In its wake, all is serene and still once more.",
			},
		},
		[99]={
			{
"The arm gripping my blade is pulverized, as though crushed by an enormous boulder.",
			},
		},
		[100]={
			{
"The spellblade itself is also shattered to pieces, but in spite of all that, Akari is safe and sound within my arms.",
			},
		},
		[101]={
			{
"My own Sickle Leaf made it in time.",
			},
		},
		[102]={
			{
"I wasn't able to counterpoise the attack completely, but I was able to at least dampen its impact.",
			},
		},
		[103]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you okay!?”",
			},
		},
		[104]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Yeah, I'm fine...”",
			},
		},
		[105]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“But look at you!”",
			},
		},
		[106]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“That's all that matters.”",
			},
		},
		[107]={
			{
"I quickly scan the surroundings, wary of a follow-up attack, but the enemy is already nowhere to be seen.",
			},
		},
		[108]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“Hehehe! How about we leave it at that for today?”",
			},
		},
		[109]={
			hide=1,
			name={"name", name="???"},
			{
"“If I take things too far, there'll be hell to pay, you know?”",
			},
		},
		[110]={
			{
"All that I perceive is the faint sound of amused mockery.",
			},
		},
		[111]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Who's there?!”",
			},
		},
		[112]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“I don't know.”",
			},
		},
		[113]={
			{
"I strain my ears to listen for traces of the enemy.",
			},
		},
		[114]={
			{
"But all I can hear is the din of fast-approaching military boots.",
			},
		},
		[115]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“The Forbidden Guard is coming. Let's get out of here.”",
			},
		},
		[116]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“What about the Treasures?”",
			},
		},
		[117]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I know, but we can't afford to get caught here!”",
			},
		},
		[118]={
			{
"I take one last look at the Shireiden.",
			},
		},
		[119]={
			{
"Despite suffering a direct hit from a Sickle Leaf, the structure has not so much as a scratch on it.",
			},
		},
		[120]={
			{
"It's likely protected by powerful magicks.",
			},
		},
		[121]={
			{
"There's no doubt that whatever is inside is important beyond measure.",
			},
		},
		[122]={
			{
"Some day, I swear I'll be back─",
			},
		},
		[123]={
			{
"Vowing this, we make our retreat.",
			},
		},
		[124]={
			{
"The two of us return to the dungeon via the secret passageway.",
			},
		},
		[125]={
			{
"By now, my body is beginning to feel the full strain of its prior overexertion.",
			},
		},
		[126]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Kh...”",
			},
		},
		[127]={
			{
"I stagger on the spot, but Akari immediately rushes over to support me.",
			},
		},
		[128]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You'll get blood on you.”",
			},
		},
		[129]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Shut it.”",
			},
		},
		[130]={
			{
"Leaning on my lord's shoulder, I continue walking.",
			},
		},
		[131]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Thank you for protecting me.”",
			},
		},
		[132]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It's my duty.”",
			},
		},
		[133]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you dare die on me here.”",
			},
		},
		[134]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Like this would be enough to do me in.”",
			},
		},
		[135]={
			{
"To lighten the mood, I retort with a smile.",
			},
		},
		[136]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Besides, if I did die here, that'd just prove I wasn't much of a warrior in the first place.”",
			},
		},
		[137]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“You should look for some better help next time.”",
			},
		},
		[138]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Oof?!”",
			},
		},
		[139]={
			{
"Akari's fist slams into my solar plexus.",
			},
		},
		[140]={
			{
"That certainly did a number on my battered body.",
			},
		},
		[141]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“What are you even saying, you jerk?!”",
			},
		},
		[142]={
			{
"Despite my flickering vision, I think I spot a single peach petal fluttering down to the ground.",
			},
		},
		[143]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Are you crying again?”",
			},
		},
		[144]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“I'm just angry is all.”",
			},
		},
		[145]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Don't you remember? I promised I wouldn't cry anymore.”",
			},
		},
		[146]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Yeah, I do.”",
			},
		},
		[147]={
			{
"It was when I pledged myself to Akari.",
			},
		},
		[148]={
			{
"That was less than a week ago, yet it feels like it's been much, much longer.",
			},
		},
		[149]={
			{
"In the distance, I can hear the telltale sound of clashing blades.",
			},
		},
		[150]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Soujin.”",
			},
		},
		[151]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“She's fighting, huh?”",
			},
		},
		[152]={
			{
"Separating myself from Akari, I stand up on my own two feet.",
			},
		},
		[153]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“Let's go. It's probably Hotori and Maki.”",
			},
		},
		[154]={
			name={"name", name="Akari"},
			{
"“Maki wasn't the one who attacked us just now?”",
			},
		},
		[155]={
			name={"name", name="Soujin"},
			{
"“It didn't feel like him.”",
			},
		},
		[156]={
			{
"My intuition tells me the shadow I glimpsed for just a moment didn't belong to Maki.",
			},
		},
		[157]={
			{
"But if not Maki, then who?",
			},
		},
		[158]={
			{
"Surely not─",
			},
		},
		[159]={
			{
"Kokuan-dono...?",
			},
		},
